title: "BrainCodes: Toward Lightweight EEG Foundation Models"
abstract: >-
  A compact EEG foundation model over frozen BioCodec residual-vector-quantized
  tokens, with a factorized time/channel hourglass transformer and rotary
  positional encoding over 3D electrode coordinates.
